## 39. Product / engineering failure potential
Because the project is simulated, direct physical harm is low. If this RTL were intended for synthesis, the key risks would be:
- multiple drivers;
- timing-latency misunderstandings;
- incomplete test-result bookkeeping;
- unreproducible missing dependency;
- lack of coverage/constraint closure.

The project itself illustrates why verification must be proportionate to the consequences of failure.

